      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GRASS IS GREENER (1) is a first starter from the Dustin Drew kennel by Aston Rupee out of Miss Integrity. Drawn favourably and can capitalise. Has a nice profile and expected to measure up at first outing. PROVISIONAL (4) was crowded for room and fell at Bendigo last time but prior to that finished third in a Maiden. May be worth another try. SUPER STITCH (2) has an honest record despite remaining a maiden and overdue for a win, having placed six of 14 career runs. Although beaten was on pace and game in defeat. Should be about the money. PAW HUXLEY (5) is likely to have admirers.",
